# Requests of lab 3.4 (REV-4), in the order of "Check it" in the lab booklet.
# Start first: EventServiceApp (port 8084), then your review-service without the profile local.
@reviewUrl = http://localhost:8083

### A review for event 1
POST {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{"author": "Alice", "stars": 5, "text": "Worth every minute."}

### A review for event 2
POST {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/2/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{"author": "Alice", "stars": 5, "text": "Will be great."}

### A review for event 999
POST {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/999/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{"author": "Alice", "stars": 4, "text": "Never heard of it."}

### Event service with --events.delay=5s: a review for event 1
POST {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{"author": "Ben", "stars": 4, "text": "Good evening."}

### Event service with --events.failure-rate=1.0: a review for event 1
POST {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{"author": "Ben", "stars": 4, "text": "Good evening."}

### Event service stopped: the reviews of event 1
GET {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/reviews
